 "content": "다음 식을 계산하시오.\n⑴ $(7x+6y)+(-9x+8y)$ ⑵ $(-8a+7b)-(-6a+9b)$\n⑶ $(13x-8y+7)-6(2x-y+2)$ ⑷ $7(2a-b-6)-(9a-8b-12)$",
 "choices": [],
 "answer": "⑴ $-2x+14y$ ⑵ $-2a-2b$\n⑶ $x-2y-5$ ⑷ $5a+b-30$",
 "solution": "⑴ $7x-9x+6y+8y=-2x+14y$이다.\n⑵ $-8a+7b+6a-9b=-2a-2b$이다.\n⑶ $13x-8y+7-12x+6y-12=x-2y-5$이다.\n⑷ $14a-7b-42-9a+8b+12=5a+b-30$이다.",
